  "description": "A webtoon highly recommended for overworked office workers! Endless overtime, never-ending tasks, and even abusive behavior from bosses. Lee Han has forgotten what happiness is, just barely getting by as he shuttles back and forth between work and home. Day after day, he has nothing to smile about, and the sorrow and anger he swallows only keep piling up. Just as he makes a wish to be happy, his guardian angel appears.\n\n *“It’s sex! If you have sex, you’ll definitely be happy!”*\n\nAnd so begins a dizzying and absurd life of cohabitation with a suspicious angel who, without warning, declares he’ll make Lee Han happy through sex! Will Lee Han truly be able to regain his true happiness?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
